  Telegram
  @pumps_bot · waiting for chat authorization

› 1. Finish connection  Send /start to the bot, select that chat, and start the connector.
  2. Replace bot token  Validate a different token from @BotFather.
  3. Forget bot         Delete this token without authorizing a chat.
  4. Refresh            Reload configuration and connector health.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
